B.apz=new A.bC(B.aGS,["location_search","CRITICAL: This function MUST be called for ANY user queries asking to PLAN A TRIP or FORM AN ITINERARY. The model should NEVER attempt to create trip plans or itineraries directly and must ALWAYS call this function instead.\n\nThis function must be called for any user queries related to travel or location-based information, including hotels, restaurants, weather, flights, events, directions, itineraries, or general location searches. The model must NOT attempt to answer these queries directly. It must ALWAYS call this function instead \u2014 regardless of whether the query is about finding, comparing, recommending, booking, checking, exploring, or creating a plan involving any of the mentioned domains.\n\nExamples include: 'Plan a trip to Japan for 7 days', 'Create an itinerary for my weekend in Paris', 'Help me plan a family vacation to Kerala', 'I want to visit Thailand, what should I do?', 'Make me a 3-day itinerary for Mumbai', 'Find a hotel in Delhi', 'Compare Hotel A and B', 'Best restaurants near CST station', 'Weather in Shimla next weekend', 'Flights from Mumbai to Goa on Friday', 'Events in Bangalore this weekend', 'Driving directions from Pune to Lonavala', 'Create an itinerary for 5 days in Kerala', etc.",B.alr],t.EU)
